  description: '1 Tuner + 4 non-Tuner monsters

    Once per turn, during either
    player''s turn, when your opponent activates a Spell/Trap Card: You can negate
    the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. If a "Flower Cardian" monster
    you control battles an opponent''s monster, that opponent''s monster has its
    effects negated during the Battle Phase only. If this face-up Synchro Summoned
    card is destroyed by battle, or leaves the field because of an opponent''s card
    effect while its owner controls it: You can Special Summon 1 "Flower Cardian"
    Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck, except "Flower Cardian Lightflare".'
